+# Lisa: the espeak-ng source is still upstream's pinned commit, but WHERE
+# it comes from is now the packager's choice. Default unchanged, so a
+# plain cmake build behaves exactly as before; the Arch package points
+# these at a clone makepkg has already fetched and checksummed, so no
+# package build reaches the network on its own (CLAUDE.md rule 8).
