+# Lisa: upstream installs ${ONNXRUNTIME_DIR}/lib/ wholesale, which now
+# resolves to the system /usr/lib -- it would copy the host into the
+# package. espeak-ng-data is likewise installed by the Arch package()
+# function, into a private directory: it must match the statically
+# linked espeak-ng commit above, so it cannot be shared with the
+# distro's /usr/share/espeak-ng-data and must not collide with it.
 
-# Copy espeak-ng-data
